{"code":"005745","name":"크라운해태홀딩스우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 2017년 크라운제과에서 식품사업부문을 인적분할하여 설립된 순수지주회사로, 크라운제과와 해태제과식품 등 9개 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 주요 수익원은 CROWN 브랜드 사용수익, 업무위탁 용역수익, 배당금 수익이며, 종속회사들은 제과류와 냉동식품, 아이스크림 제조 및 판매를 하고 있음. 지주회사 체제를 통해 기업지배구조 투명성을 높이고, 사업부문별 전문적 의사결정 체제를 확립하여 책임경영과 경영위험 분산을 추구하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":5150.0,"open":5180.0,"high":5180.0,"low":4980.0,"volume":27,"amount":139050.0,"ret_1d":1.1788,"gap":1.7682,"range_pct":3.8835,"ret_5":3.6217,"ret_20":-0.7707,"ret_60":0.9804,"ret_120":-31.516,"ret_250":-37.877,"ma20":5129.0,"ma60":5201.5,"ma120":5715.4583,"ma200":6500.075,"close_vs_ma200":-20.7701,"close_vs_ma60":-0.9901,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-12.4384,"r2_60":0.172,"slope_120":-54.6962,"r2_120":0.7062,"slope_250":-44.9737,"r2_250":0.8542,"high52":8960.0,"low52":4425.0,"pos_52w":15.9868,"dd_52w":-42.5223,"mdd_1y":-40.9739,"atr14_pct":2.1706,"vol_ann_60":31.7347,"vol_avg20":852.05,"vol_ratio20":0.0317,"vr5":0.0831,"vr20":0.6056,"amount_avg5":470024.0,"amount_avg20":4301678.0,"amount_avg60":5490848.0,"obv_chg20":-65.9527,"turnover_20":2.8367,"pv_eff_20":-0.2717,"rsi14":50.8441,"frgn_net_5":-4.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0007,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0007,"frgn_net_20":-40.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0067,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0067,"frgn_net_60":-49.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0082,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.0082,"frgn_net_120":83.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.0138,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.0138,"foreign_ratio":3.07,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.01,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":126.0,"op_margin_q":4.7601,"op_qoq":-15.4362,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-13.6986,"rev_yoy":-3.1822,"op_trend_4q":7.163,"fin_period":"202606","roe":4.96,"debt_ratio":95.37,"per":4.57,"pbr":0.21,"div_yield":2.62,"foreign_ra